[{"type":"message","user":"U023BF90BFS","text":"\u003c@U023BF90BFS\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1631003154.332700","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"DF163563-FC25-4A72-8617-827350A089F2","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"リスタートの直後にコマンド実行しようとするとそういうエラーが出るときありますが、status が running だと違うかも？","ts":"1630985309.332400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R9K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01cd5a28-81e1-436c-bf7d-7b6e5db1ca8c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"いえ\n自分の作ったプラグインでエラーが一度発生すると動作しなくなるので\nその際に denops#server#restart() をして、またプラグインを使おうとすると↑の事象が起きます\n\nちょっと再現が難しいので、再現手順が固まったらまたここに投下します","ts":"1630985185.331000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rTllh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2e0e6bf-2190-452d-8ad4-0f2a24991a50","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"PC休止状態にしたりとかしてます？","ts":"1630981996.328100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qc2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b9d1633-4ac8-4a13-ba1b-8114c409c84a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"denopsでstatusがrunningになっているので、なぜかこういうエラーが出るときがあるんですが、同じ事象になったひといますか？\nちょっと調査の時間取れるときに調べてみようと思っていますが… \n```Error detected while processing function denops#notify[1]..denops#server#notify:\nline    2:\nE605: Exception not caught: The server is not ready yet```","ts":"1630981389.327100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"thinking_face","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+PvY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b711ea0c-c3c2-461d-9347-bbfb59dbc4a1","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"これで「任意のプラグインがロードされたら処理を実行」を Vim script 側で記載可能になりました。","ts":"1630980500.324900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":7,"users":["U06ECBRTJ","UAZ33BKV2","U01D44KSY9Z","U01R5R36QK0","UAUFDS92N","U01G63H9VN3","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hVd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9a63625-870a-4b30-96c2-fb125ed815e5","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"`denops#plugin#wait()` 等を含むバージョンを v1.9.0 でリリースしました。\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/releases/tag/v1.9.0\u003e","ts":"1630980435.324300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":7,"users":["U06ECBRTJ","U01D44KSY9Z","U01R5R36QK0","UAUFDS92N","U01G63H9VN3","U9S4G0LJW","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"APdPu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2de18fc9-5f3a-4e18-91f7-446560451bbc","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"お、なるほど\nそういえばロードマップ確認してなかった","ts":"1630980136.323800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6/N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec49a3ee-d756-42cb-9907-16b581f017db","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"それは私が要望出したのでロードマップに入ってる","ts":"1630980085.323400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n+Df"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c214e05-d751-4559-b264-97d66be7d333","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"それはddskkのを踏襲してる感じですかね\nあとひらがな・カタカナモードの変化もmodelineに表示できればおいしい気がしてる","ts":"1630979946.323000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rGu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67dc7ae3-540d-45b3-af46-1564cbb2326d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"eskk のモードでカーソルの色を変えてくれるやつも地味に助かってる","ts":"1630979898.322200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6AhK1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c979d05-4afe-4dbb-8cd7-9b3fd9b66cad","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"最悪ひらがなモードにさえなれば個人的には問題ないしこれでいいといえばいい","ts":"1630979849.321800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GrwXY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9eacbba-bd81-403c-9720-b23af7f5761d","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"contextをどう引き回してるのか分からない……\n前回のconverterをどうやって二回目に適用させるか","ts":"1630979702.319900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3P+BW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3b9fbf7-d047-451b-be97-5673527f6566","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"高機能なのは伊達じゃないですね","ts":"1630979283.318700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Ym8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a93034c-378c-41fd-b09f-ec77818edccd","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"eskk色々あるなぁ","ts":"1630979194.318400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NrU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a5b3c0e-0c28-49a6-8d3d-9d6babfa6a47","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"eskkはカタカナモードも保持してるのでそっちに合わせよう","ts":"1630977203.318000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VQ3+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"479118e1-fe2f-4f70-9c95-6f4eed656aff","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"とりあえずforkしてるリポジトリにpushしておくか","ts":"1630977058.317700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EoSH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa2468e7-3d96-4f14-8339-d145b5d971a6","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"eskkにあった `keep_state` をskkeletonに入れようと画策してる\n一応できはしたけど、ここに仕込んで変な副作用起きないかなと不安\nあとカタカナモードを保持するかも悩みどころ（実装がちょっとめんどくさそう）","ts":"1630977038.317300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aloZK"}]}]
